{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>兌吧宣布旗下AI人工智能短劇業務，於7至9月連續三個月錄得純利，較上半年經營業績顯著改善。</p><p></p><p>上半年AI短劇新增全網播放量超過50億次，而7至9月的新增全網播放量按月急增，至9月已超過264億次。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:02.934171+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T23:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:05.411136+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:05.411136+00:00","content_hash":"1f2f12817cbfb4037194652ba3c56f87a0db7919af45aeb9d91431594a572aad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}